commit 625241f07f20a428443592276b8ab4efd10465e7
Author: Marcel Angelo Navarro <marcel.a.n.navarro@accenture.com>
Date:   Sun Sep 13 08:51:17 2026 +0800

    fix(drawer): SFCC-831 correct ZimmDrawer header sizing to match Figma

    HEADER_HEIGHT_MOBILE was 8px short of Figma's 80px mobile spec, and the
    new `prompt` size inherited the mobile-compact header treatment at every
    breakpoint instead of Figma's 92px auto-height (py:24) at md+. Fixing the
    override alone didn't reach 92px until a second gap surfaced: the boxed
    close button had no real 44px row to pad around, so a new
    `headerCloseButton` recipe part gives it one, mirroring how the floating
    close button already gets this via its own `closeButton` part.

    Live-measured: 80px @390px, 92px @834px and @1440px, matching Figma.
    HEADER_HEIGHT_MOBILE is shared baseStyle, so this also corrects
    zimmWishlistAuthDrawer's mobile header height — the only other real
    consumer that renders the `header` part.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/overrides/app/components/ui-kits/atoms/zimmDrawer/index.test.tsx b/overrides/app/components/ui-kits/atoms/zimmDrawer/index.test.tsx
